<concept id="links" xml:lang="en-us">
  <title>Links</title>
  <conbody>
    <p>In web documents, links can point different locations on the page, different pages, or even downloadable documents, such as Word documents or PDFs:</p>
    <p>
      <xref href="../sample_document/sample_document.dita" format="dita">Top of this Page</xref>
      <xref href="http://www.dhs.state.il.us/page.aspx?item=67072" scope="external" format="html">Sample Document</xref>
      <xref href="http://www.dhs.state.il.us/OneNetLibrary/27897/documents/Initiatives/IITAA/Sample-Document.docx" scope="external" format="html">Sample Document (docx)</xref>
    </p>
  </conbody>
</concept>